Package: vhackintosh-control
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Felipe Abreu <felipeab10@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd, python3 (>= 3.12), openssl, curl, kbd, sway, swaybg, seatd,
 dbus-x11, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, libvulkan1,
 mesa-vulkan-drivers, libgtk-3-0t64, libepoxy0, libpixman-1-0, libslirp0,
 libpng16-16t64, libjpeg-turbo8, libasound2t64, libpulse0, libzstd1,
 libncurses6, libbz2-1.0, libusb-1.0-0, libnuma1, libglib2.0-0
Description: vHackintosh Control and macOS VM host manager
 Installs the HTTPS management dashboard, HTTP redirect, pinned OpenCorePkg
 macserial, APV-enabled reims-util utility, and vendored guest kexts, local privileged management agent,
 and active desktop session integration with a shared Wayland fallback on Ubuntu 24.04 LTS amd64. The Reims vGPU
 runtime is downloaded from the configured GitHub fork after first sign-in.
